### Part A: Window Controls Fix (`windowAPI` & Titlebars)

#### [MODIFY] [preload.js](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/preload.js)
- Expose `windowAPI`:
  ```javascript
  contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld('windowAPI', {
    minimize: () => ipcRenderer.send('window:minimize'),
    close: () => ipcRenderer.send('window:close')
  });
  ```

#### [MODIFY] [main.js](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/main.js)
- Add window control IPC listeners scoped dynamically to the calling sender window:
  ```javascript
  ipcMain.on('window:minimize', (event) => {
    const win = BrowserWindow.fromWebContents(event.sender);
    if (win) win.minimize();
  });

  ipcMain.on('window:close', (event) => {
    const win = BrowserWindow.fromWebContents(event.sender);
    if (win) win.close();
  });
  ```

