### Part B: Battery Percentage & Periodic Broadcast Fix

#### [MODIFY] [lexer.py](file:///d:/door-os/python-services/lexer.py)
- Update `show_battery()` to handle `psutil.sensors_battery() == None` for desktop systems.
- Use `round(battery.percent)` to eliminate raw floating-point numbers.
- Provide structured output payload with integer percentage, charging state, and desktop detection status.

#### [MODIFY] [main.js](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/main.js)
- Implement periodic 30-second battery checking & broadcast (`battery_update` event) to all active windows (`BrowserWindow.getAllWindows()`).

#### [MODIFY] [renderer.js](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/renderer.js), [settings.js](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/settings.js), [control-panel.js](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/control-panel.js)
- Update listeners to react to `type: "battery_update"` / `action: "show_battery"` to keep Taskbar, Settings, and Control Panel completely in sync.

